  "problem": "$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 10 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 5 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the matrix given above. Identify **all** of the reasons why one can conclude that $|A|=0?$\n\n- $A$ has identical columns\n- $A$ has a zero column\n- $A$ has identical rows",
